    {
      "id": "6e11fa27-706c-4288-af16-42b3c71bce83",
      "data": {
        "body": "Our Cherokee words to talk about a piece of clothing, like a shirt or pants, normally say who that item belongs to. In this lesson you'll learn how to say different items of clothing, and change them to talk about different people.",
        "title": "Clothing words"
      },
      "type": "context"
